<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alliance raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alliance raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said analyst Scott Randall upgraded Alliance Semiconductor Corp to short-term buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $0.30 per share from $0.09.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1999 earnings estimate to $0.74 per share from $0.50.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/16 to 10-5/8.</p>
</text>
